   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "h3",
   "text": "Moss walls",
   "anchor": null
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "How do you give an office or company interior that finishing touch? Bring a piece of nature indoors with a moss wall and win your guests over with an unconventional design feature.",
