  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Custom-made production: whether you want modern minimalist pieces or a lavish, creative solution, we can adapt every detail to match your ideas and your needs.",
   "anchor": "designova-svitidla"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: designer lights come in all shapes and sizes, for commercial spaces as well as residential interiors, whether that means restaurants, offices or hotels.",
   "anchor": "designova-svitidla"
  },
