  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Bulb-lit signs",
   "anchor": "zarovkove-svetelne-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Looking for something unique for your space? Unconventional designer lighting can completely change the atmosphere of a room, give it character and meet practical requirements at the same time.",
   "anchor": "zarovkove-svetelne-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Construction: a bulb-lit sign is built around a sheet-metal body holding the bulbs. We care about quality and about the environment, so we use highly efficient LED bulbs and let you choose the shade of light.",
   "anchor": "zarovkove-svetelne-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: they work especially well in commercial spaces, restaurants, shops, cinemas or club venues, where they draw customers in and give the place a character of its own. Mount them above the entrance, on the building façade, or use them as interior decoration.",
   "anchor": "zarovkove-svetelne-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "zarovkove-svetelne-napisy"
  },
  {
