   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Neon signs & imitations",
   "anchor": "neonove-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Classic glass neon tubes give a sign an unmistakable character, a distinctive pattern of light and a genuinely authentic visual effect.",
   "anchor": "neonove-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Neon tubes let us create original lettering, logos and design features with an atmosphere other technologies struggle to imitate.",
   "anchor": "neonove-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Neon sign imitation in acrylic glass: we bend acrylic glass into the shape you choose and light it from within with quality LED modules. The result is a luxurious effect with significant savings compared with classic neon – and with no glass involved, a safer choice indoors.",
   "anchor": "neonove-napisy"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: ideal wherever originality, style and a true neon impression are the goal. You end up with an illuminated feature that impresses through its looks and its craftsmanship alike.",
   "anchor": "neonove-napisy"
  },
