  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Moss walls",
   "anchor": "mechove-steny"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Working with our suppliers, we can produce not only moss walls but also moss pictures carrying an advertising message.",
   "anchor": "mechove-steny"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Why a moss wall: they look superb and they bring practical benefits. They are environmentally friendly, easy to look after and need none of the care live plants demand. On top of that they improve room acoustics and help clean the air.",
   "anchor": "mechove-steny"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: ideal for offices, company lobbies and receptions, restaurants and hotels, retail spaces or showrooms, where they combine beautifully with advertising lettering and logos.",
   "anchor": "mechove-steny"
  },
