  {
   "type": "h2",
   "text": "Corten steel signage",
   "anchor": "reklama-z-cortenoveho-plechu"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "A material with a natural rust patina that takes on a unique look over time and is ideal for façades or outdoor spaces.",
   "anchor": "reklama-z-cortenoveho-plechu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Material: weathering steel (known as rusted steel) is highly durable and ideal above all for outdoor placement. Its distinctive appearance comes from the naturally rusty patina that develops over time, adding a unique aesthetic effect.",
   "anchor": "reklama-z-cortenoveho-plechu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Placement: corten steel is used not only for advertising lettering but also for a range of design features such as logos, graphic patterns and decorative panels, which can go on building façades or into outdoor spaces.",
   "anchor": "reklama-z-cortenoveho-plechu"
  },
  {
   "type": "a",
   "text": "Request a no-obligation quote",
   "anchor": "reklama-z-cortenoveho-plechu"
  },
  {
