   "anchor": "svetelna-cisla-domu"
  },
  {
   "type": "p",
   "text": "Give your home something special and dress up its exterior with an illuminated or non-illuminated number. Illuminated numbers are not only a practical solution but a design feature in their own right.",
   "anchor": "svetelna-cisla-domu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Version: choose from various types of backlighting that keep the number visible at night, or a version without backlighting that works as an elegant, modern detail. Warm white light or cool blue backlighting, we will match it to your wishes.",
   "anchor": "svetelna-cisla-domu"
  },
  {
   "type": "li",
   "text": "Installation: we take care of the complete production and installation of numbers that suit any style and any type of building.",
   "anchor": "svetelna-cisla-domu"
  },
